4.4    Genetic Algorithm
The  Genetic  Algorithm  operates  on  a  population  of  random-key  chromosomes.   Each  chromosome
represents a candidate routing solution.
Parent chromosomes are selected using tournament selection.  Crossover is applied with probabilityp
c
